  {"t": "Colour the night sky around the house in blue, then layer violet over it, darker at the top. Near the flames let a little orange glow blend into the violet.", "e": [{"l": "b", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M15 15H385V252H15Z\" fill=\"url(#colpencil-2-sky)\" fill-opacity=\"0.95\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "b", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M15 15H385V252H15Z\" fill=\"url(#colpencil-2-h1)\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "b", "s": "<path class=\"fd\" d=\"M70 120a130 130 0 1 0 260 0a130 130 0 1 0 -260 0Z\" fill=\"url(#colpencil-2-warm)\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "b", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M15 240C80 232 120 244 200 246S330 236 385 242V262H15Z\" fill=\"#1f3b2c\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}]},
  {"t": "Fill the house walls and roof with dark violet, then dark green, pressing hard so they become nearly black against the fire. Add the dark green bank either side, with a few reeds.", "e": [{"l": "f", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M130 252V176L200 118L270 176V252Z\" fill=\"#2a1d3f\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "f", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M130 252V176L200 118L270 176V252Z\" fill=\"url(#colpencil-2-h2)\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "f", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M15 250H385V262H15Z\" fill=\"#16301f\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, "<path class=\"ln\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M40 262l-4-26M46 262l3-20M330 262l-3-24M338 262l4-18M360 262l-2-22\" style=\"stroke:#0f2a1a;stroke-width:2;fill:none\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"]},
  {"t": "For the river, colour violet and dark blue in long sideways strokes. Under the house, draw its upside-down reflection and broken horizontal dashes of yellow, orange and red for the reflected flames.", "e": [{"l": "b", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M15 262H385V385H15Z\" fill=\"url(#colpencil-2-water)\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "b", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M15 262H385V385H15Z\" fill=\"url(#colpencil-2-h3)\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, {"l": "f", "s": "<path class=\"sh\" d=\"M130 262V322L200 364L270 322V262Z\" fill=\"#1b1530\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"}, "<path class=\"ln\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M161 268h22M172.5 268h18.6M158.5 273h27.8M211.7 273h23.1M250.2 278h17.3M234.3 283h10.6M215.1 283h16.2M174.6 283h27M195.8 288h10.6M246.8 288h28.5M142.7 288h17.5M193.2 293h28.2M238.8 293h19.7M195.8 293h10.1M203.4 298h17.6M180.9 298h8.8M215.2 298h27.2M156.5 303h25.9M239.3 303h15.3M169.2 303h12.8M231.6 308h16.9M127.6 308h22.9M182.3 308h17.3M152.4 313h18.3M227.3 313h11.4M164.1 318h13.1M213.9 318h8.1M184.8 323h18.6M241.5 323h11M250.2 328h12.6M149.2 328h18.7M249.8 333h20.6M161.9 338h6.3M261.3 343h13.1M129.9 343h10.6M214.7 348h8.8M197.6 348h12.2\" style=\"stroke:#ffd84a;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>", "<path class=\"ln\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M219.9 353h11.3M227.3 353h11.3M160.7 358h17M234.1 363h13.7M200.3 363h5.3M127.8 363h5.3M158.7 368h9.6M203.9 373h12.1M258.5 373h7.2M129.9 373h9.1M207.6 378h7.7\" style=\"stroke:#ff8a1c;stroke-width:2.4;fill:none\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>", "<path class=\"ln\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"\" style=\"stroke:#d4231c;stroke-width:2.2;fill:none\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"]},
  {"t": "Rub out the guides and burnish the hottest centre of the fire with white until it is smooth and bright, adding a few white sparks. Warm flames against cool violet and blue give strong contrast, so the fire becomes the emphasis.", "e": ["<path class=\"fd\" d=\"M186 136C183.7 133.7 184.3 124 186 120C187.7 116 193 111.7 196 112C199 112.3 201.3 122.7 204 122C206.7 121.3 209.7 107.3 212 108C214.3 108.7 217.7 120.7 218 126C218.3 131.3 217 138.7 214 140C211 141.3 204.7 134.7 200 134C195.3 133.3 188.3 138.3 186 136Z\" fill=\"#fffef2\" fill-opacity=\"0.95\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>", "<path class=\"fd\" d=\"M225.4 32.8h0\" style=\"stroke:#fff6d0;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;fill:none\"/><path class=\"fd\" d=\"M191.7 28.8h0M209.6 76h0M208.8 83.1h0M177 56.6h0M222.5 104.1h0M169.7 80.1h0M150.8 52.4h0M172.1 58.9h0\" style=\"stroke:#fff6d0;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;fill:none\"/><path class=\"fd\" d=\"M212 21.5h0M184.3 104.1h0M153.3 63.9h0\" style=\"stroke:#fff6d0;stroke-width:2.5;stroke-linecap:round;fill:none\"/><path class=\"fd\" d=\"M249.4 91.8h0M250.2 68.1h0M184.4 82.6h0M176.2 49.5h0\" style=\"stroke:#fff6d0;stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round;fill:none\"/>", "<path class=\"ln\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M178 270h44M188 278h24\" style=\"stroke:#fffef0;stroke-width:2.4;fill:none\" filter=\"url(#grain)\"/>"], "erase": true}
